        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-stance-p02-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "亲自 + action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "亲自 emphasizes that the relevant person performs the action rather than delegating it. It does not mean doing it alone.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "老师亲自来了。",
                "pinyin": "lǎoshī qīnzì lái le 。",
                "meaning": "The teacher came in person.",
                "audio": "8d384f2171fe2bc63b25bdb88c8cd32f1e85e15b1bccc5cfab2d7c3b89f101f1"
              },
              {
                "text": "我亲自给他打电话。",
                "pinyin": "wǒ qīnzì gěi tā dǎdiànhuà 。",
                "meaning": "I called him myself.",
                "audio": "83771947c98b2846803151db796d4a1264cd0c18cc5dd1fd9356eefea0360591"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
